                "text": "Unions have given generations of families a fair shot at the American Dream \u2014 including my own. Labor Day is a chance to celebrate the generations of workers who fought for safer workplaces, fair wages, health care, and dignity.\n\nWhile Washington Republicans are rolling back protections for unions, I\u2019ll continue to stand with New Jersey workers to protect collective bargaining rights and invest in the people who built our state and keep it running.",
