                "text": "As social media algorithms change how we navigate our world, NJ\u2019s youngest generation is facing an unprecedented mental health crisis \u2014 that\u2019s why as governor, I\u2019m introducing a bold plan to protect kids online, and stop Big Tech billionaires from putting them in harm\u2019s way. https://t.co/eEfsp9SU7l",
