                "reply_count": 112,
                "retweet_count": 41,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trust isn\u2019t given \u2014 it\u2019s earned.\n\nI\u2019m grateful to Reverend Boyer for his clarity and conviction in this moment. As governor, I look forward to working together to deliver real results for Black New Jerseyans \u2014 from ending the Black maternal health crisis to making sure our seniors can afford to stay in the communities they built.\nhttps://t.co/Q9wQahEtHf",
