                "reply_count": 100,
                "retweet_count": 47,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": ".@FirstLadyNJ\u2019s work on maternal health, along with advocates across the state, has set us up to be a state that has better outcomes for every mother and child. As a mom of four kids myself, I am committed to building on this progress so that all mothers, especially Black women, have a safer and healthier experience giving birth. I was grateful to join Nurture NJ\u2019s conference this morning \u2014 but most importantly, I'm grateful for the essential work that the healthcare workers, advocates, midwives, and doulas in the room are doing every day to advance this cause.",
