                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Washington Republicans should bring the three-year Affordable Care Act tax extensions to a vote immediately so American families can have peace of mind over the holidays knowing they can afford their health insurance in the new year.\n\u00a0\nThese are New Jersey's tax dollars. They should be used to provide healthcare for working families in our state.\n\nhttps://t.co/5IAK0G1NKv",
