                "reply_count": 120,
                "retweet_count": 46,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am thrilled to introduce my nominee to lead the Department of Human Services, Dr. Stephen Cha. \n\nDr. Cha is a nationally recognized healthcare expert who served in the US Dept. of Health and Human Services and a former primary care provider for people experiencing homelessness. \n\nAs we prepare for the devastating impact of Trump\u2019s cuts to Medicaid and SNAP, he brings the experience and expertise we need to protect New Jersey and deliver for our state. \n\nWelcome to the team, Dr. Cha!",
